# Fluid Slider — a Skia metaball slider (blur + alpha-threshold colour matrix) whose picker bubble lifts off the track on a spring while sliding and shows 0..100 drawn with a Skia font.
# What this test covers: tap-to-jump at several points of the track (onStart sets the picker), a slow drag across,
# dragging past both ends (picker clamped to the radius, label clamped 0/100), fast back-and-forth drags that
# interrupt the lift/drop spring, a long hold without moving (bubble stays lifted), and taps right at the track's ends.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/fluid-slider"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 1200
# Tap-to-jump at a few points.
press 100 438
wait 700
press 300 438
wait 700
press 200 438
wait 700
# Slow drag across most of the track.
gesture pan 30 438 300 0 1200
wait 800
# Drag past the right end (clamps to 100), then past the left end (clamps to 0).
gesture pan 200 438 200 0 600
wait 800
gesture pan 390 438 -385 0 600
wait 800
# Fast back-and-forth: lift/drop springs interrupted.
gesture pan 30 438 340 0 150
gesture pan 370 438 -340 0 150
gesture pan 30 438 340 0 150
wait 900
# Hold still on the track: the bubble stays lifted, then drops on release.
longpress 150 438 1500
wait 900
# The very ends of the track.
press 13 438
wait 500
press 389 438
wait 500
# A drag that wanders vertically off the track keeps tracking x.
gesture pan 100 438 150 120 700
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
